  data: {
    LLM: "In Phase One, try to win tricks to collect high cards for Phase Two, but don't collect too many cards. In Phase Two, save your highest cards for when you really need them.\n\nIn Phase One, control when you win tricks - winning early tricks gives you control but also more cards to shed later. Try to collect cards in strong suits (Spades and Hearts).\n\nCard counting is crucial. Track which high cards have been played in Phase One to predict opponents' holdings in Phase Two. In Phase Two, force opponents to use their high cards early by playing medium cards that are difficult to beat without using premium cards.",
